  "description": "The META POWER SX V4 BOSCH SIGNATURE is a build with top-end components suitable for those who wish to compete and ride the most challenging trails.\n• Kashima-coated stanchions, a stiffer e-bike specific body, and the Grip2 cartridge, the FOX 38 Factory offers the most advanced settings. On the back, the Float X Factory with settings adapted to the frame's kinematics provides excellent dynamics while offering low speed rebound/compression adjustments and a firm lockout for climbing anywhere.\n• Chosen for their crisp feel and reliability, the SHIMANO XT 4-piston callipers with 220mm discs handle braking.\n• DT SWISS HX1700 wheels are made of high-end aluminium. Designed for e-MTB use and assembled by hand, they are strong and reliable.\n• A SHIMANO XT 12-speed drivetrain is efficient and durable.",
